3df5da271bcdde","name":"B"}]}],"simulationFolders":[],"source":{"dialect":"spice3f5-core","entry":"submitted.spice","files":[{"content":{"encoding":"utf-8","text":"* Always-on LDO: PMOS pass, PMOS-input OTA, current-mirror gate drive, adaptive tail\n.subckt DUT VIN VOUT VSS VREF\n* pass device (W/L = 1000) and its 1:50 diode-connected gate driver\nXMP VOUT G VIN VIN sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 W=87.5 L=0.35 nf=1 m=4\nXMD G G VIN VIN sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 W=7 L=0.35 nf=1 m=1\n* load-sense copy feeding the error-amp tail (adaptive bias)\nXMS T G VIN VIN sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 W=7 L=0.35 nf=1 m=1\n* NMOS driver pulling the pass gate\nXMB G X VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=3 L=1 nf=1 m=1\n* error amplifier: PMOS pair, NMOS mirror load\nXM1 A VREF T VIN sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 W=10 L=0.5 nf=1 m=4\nXM2 X FB T VIN sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 W=10 L=0.5 nf=1 m=4\nXM3 A A VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=3 L=1 nf=1 m=1\nXM4 X A VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=3 L=1 nf=1 m=1\n* minimum tail bias from VIN-referenced resistor bias\nXM5 T PB VIN VIN sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 W=2 L=2 nf=1 m=4\nXMPB PB PB VIN VIN sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 W=2 L=2 nf=1 m=1\nRB PB VSS 10meg\n* feedback divider with feed-forward capacitor\nR1 VOUT FB 3meg\nR2 FB VSS 3meg\nCFF VOUT FB 1p\n.ends DUT\n"},"hash":"sha256:dc13b27106f0af059a362a2ea962d8d280c8100faaf4045903a4a86297059c22","id":"source-c64c2f6b688cd548","path":"submitted.spice"}],"sourcePolicy":"copy"},"symbolLibrary":{"hash":"razavi-reference-v1","id":"razavi-symbols","version":"1"},"structureRevision":0}
